/-!
# The exceptional finite odd-prime source exclusions in A.3.15

These are the actual full-Sylow pair exclusions for J2, HS, Ru and the Tits
group at five, Held at five or seven, J4 at eleven, and genuine triality at
field order two and prime seven. Every model consumer retains the original
component isomorphism and ambient permuting pair. The independent carrier
order sieve supplies the displayed prime specializations in final assembly.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, Proposition 1.3.4, printed pp.510–511.
-/
